<title>DENMARK: ISS sees full year op. profit up 8 pct.</title>
<headline>ISS sees full year op. profit up 8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish cleaning group ISS on Tuesday said it expected 1997 to show an eight percent rise in turnover and operating profit before other earnings and expenses compared to 1996.</p>
</text>
